---
title: "refund (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_timing: contract not paused
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: block.timestamp > refundEndTime or block.timestamp < endTime
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodInactive
    q_check_timing --> q_check_refunded: within refund period
    q_check_refunded --> q_revert_dup: position.hasRefunded == true
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert AlreadyRefunded
    q_check_refunded --> q_get_amount: position.hasRefunded == false
    q_get_amount --> q_check_balance: amount = position.investedCapital
    q_check_balance --> q_revert_zero: amount == 0
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert NoInvestment
    q_check_balance --> q_update_state: amount > 0
    q_update_state --> q_transfer: position.hasRefunded = true, totalCapitalInvested -= amount
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, amount), emit Refunded

    note right of q_check_timing
        INV-001: refunds only during designated refund period (endTime, refundEndTime)
    end note

    note right of q_update_state
        INV-002: position marked as refunded before transfer (reentrancy protection)
        INV-003: totalCapitalInvested decreases by exact refund amount
        INV-004: each investor can refund at most once
    end note
